repository-code: "https://github.com/ultralightbeat/cardiac-inr"
abstract: >-
  A per-patient sine-activated neural field (SIREN) that represents a cardiac
  cine-MRI scan as one continuous function of position and time, evaluated on
  hidden frames and slices of the public ACDC dataset, with a 4D heart model
  and an ejection-fraction check.
keywords:
  - neural fields
  - implicit neural representation
  - SIREN
  - cardiac MRI
  - cine-MRI
